# Play test of Gilded Skull Cove (CIPlay gilded_skull_cove, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the
# captain's camp on the cove's beach (1.8 m), the cook's glade west of it (4 m), the trail east and up to the saddle's
# stones (6 m), along the saddle's east ridge to the lookout's pad on the east peak's shoulder (9 m; the hut's deck 15.5 m,
# its ladder from the pad), the wreck in the cove's mouth (her bed 10 m down).
island Gilded Skull Cove
expect step 0
expect title The Gilded Skull's Hoard
wait 3

# Ashore at the captain's camp: the cove, her letter in the longboat
walk 6 27 to 4 25.5 to 1.5 24.5 h=1.8
zone cove
expect step 0
read Captain's last letter
expect step 1

# The cook's glade up the bank west of the camp: her hogs come out of the ferns; her tin by the hollow log
walk 1 23.5 to -3 23.4 to -7 23.2 to -10.5 23 h=4
zone spring
kill Warthog
expect step 2
open Cook Tamsin's tin
expect story mappiece 1

# Out to the cove's mouth: the wreck of the Gilded Skull, the navigator's chart chest by her side, the sunken barrel
at 3 47 h=-5.5
zone wreck
expect step 3
open Navigator Pell's chart chest
open Sunken rum barrel
expect story mappiece 2

# Up the trail to the saddle (its stones' zone is passed - counted for its step when it comes) and along its east ridge
# to the bosun's lookout on the east peak's shoulder; up its ladder: his sea chest, his stash under the floor
walk 4 23.5 to 5.3 16.2 to 6.7 10.8 to 5.25 7 to 3.5 4.5 h=6
walk 3.5 4.5 to 6.5 2.3 to 9.5 2.75 to 11.4 1.7 to 11.4 -1.4 h=9
climb 11 -2.62 h=9
expect stand 10.5 -5 h=15.5 below=17
open Bosun Kell's sea chest
open Bosun's stash
expect story mappiece 3
expect step 4

# Back at the camp: the map table takes the three pieces and gives the whole map and its verse (the stones' step, done
# early on the way up, counts at once)
use maptable
expect message torn edges fit
expect story mappiece 0
expect story wholemap 1
walk 4 23.5 to 5.3 16.2 to 6.7 10.8 to 5.25 7 to 3.5 4.5 h=6
zone stones
expect step 6

# The stones: the wrong order first (they refuse), then the verse's: north, tall, flat - the hoard comes up
use stone2
expect message won't move
use stone3
expect message held fast
expect hidden hoard
use stone1
expect message grinds
use stone2
expect message settles
use stone3
expect message rolls aside
wait 3
expect shown hoard
open Captain Marrow's hoard
wait 2
expect item Blueprint_DetailPlank 1
expect item Hat_Pirate 1
expect done
